OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 bomber in 50,000-poppy release
OL,4,Ato mark appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 50,000 poppies will be released
OL,7,Ffrom a World War Two bomber aircraft to
OL,8,Fmark the start of a county's annual
OL,9,Fpoppy appeal.
OL,11,FThe paper flowers will be let go from
OL,12,Fbeneath the wings of the Avro Lancaster
OL,13,FJust Jane at the Lincolnshire Aviation
OL,14,FHeritage Centre at 14:00 BST on 24
OL,15,FOctober.
OL,17,FA service will also be held by the
OL,18,FRoyal British Legion in the main hangar
OL,19,Fat the site, which is located on the
OL,20,Fformer RAF East Kirkby, at 11:00.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
