OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 bomber in 50,000-poppy release
OL,4,Ato mark appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeneral manager Andrew Panton said:
OL,7,F"It's just a nice way of linking up the
OL,8,Fsite here, the Lancaster, and the poppy
OL,9,Fappeal itself. It's a full circle thing
OL,10,Fto be able to bring what's left here at
OL,11,FEast Kirkby to be relevant to the poppy
OL,12,Fappeal as well."
